  "findings": [
    {
      "subject": "GR-G3",
      "confirmed": "Research token has no carrier and no run producer. Exact research G3 includes tensoriality, curvature symmetries, Bianchi, and Jacobi; it is NOT the first variation supplier.",
      "repair": "For the actual Einstein-variation use, replace the unresolved GR-G3 edge with already-declared published thm-gr-second-bianchi-and-divergence-free-einstein (Statement b, exact covariant divergence) and existing typed curvature definition. Do not create a universal alias for all G3. If explicit Ricci symmetry is invoked, cite thm-gr-curvature-algebraic-symmetries(d). Update owning manifest/contract/readiness only by Root after source review. Current public Statement can remain exact.",
      "first_variation": "Published thm-gr-compact-metric-and-timelike-curve-variation(a-d) supplies inverse direction, delta Gamma, Palatini, and local density; (e) proves action only for compact support IN ONE chart. Current global compact action claim needs finite-chart local proof below, not a broad assertion that supplier(e) already covers it."
    },
    {
      "subject": "global compact integration",
      "confirmed": "lem-emg-maxwell-action-variation step2.1 chooses one coordinate rectangle around arbitrary compact support; no global chart assumption is in its Statement. lem-emg-einstein-action-variation F1/step1.1 similarly overstates chart-action supplier. Published finite singular-chain Stokes alone is not a theorem on arbitrary compact support on M.",
      "repair": "Retain full scope. Add exact imported thm-smooth-partitions-of-unity-exist-on-manifolds and its countable-choice hypothesis. For compact support K choose chart-subordinate locally finite partition rho_i; compactness makes only finitely many supports meet K. rho_i W has compact support in its chart (closed subset of K, contained in that chart). Each chart divergence integrates to zero by FTC/Fubini. Sum div(rho_i W)=div W because sum rho_i=1 and sum d rho_i=0 near K. Finite sums also justify global differentiation under compactly supported action integrals using each chart uniform derivative argument. For EH V is global because delta Gamma is a tensor. Realizability globally follows compact fixed-signature stability already used locally; finite chart cover makes the parameter bound uniform. This is proof-only repair in batch3 Maxwell then batch4 Einstein; consumers need status/context refresh, not invented public-interface propagation."
    },
    {
      "subject": "lem-emg-maxwell-observer-stress",
      "confirmed": "Statement currently has T_EM=mu0^-1 Q(F), no alpha conversion. Source solutions/proofs.md X0 explicitly requires it.",
      "repair": "Add part(d): for arbitrary fixed G_N>0 set alpha to the positive square root of 4*pi*G_N/(mu0*c^4), mathcal F=alpha F and kappa_E=8*pi*G_N/c^4. Define Q_g(H)_ab=H_ac H_b^c-(1/4)g_ab H_cd H^cd for any real two-form H. Then Q_g(lambda H)=lambda^2 Q_g(H) for every real lambda, and kappa_E T_EM=2Q_g(mathcal F). Show each raised component scales linearly and each product quadratically; 2alpha^2=8piG_N/(mu0c^4). All constants formal positive coefficients; no empirical assertion. Positive-root supplier is already authored on MG02 and may be cited if needed.",
      "units": "Length coordinates x0=ct, dimensionless g_ab, SI F_ab in tesla=Wb/m^2, T_EM in J/m^3, [alpha]=m^-1 tesla^-1=A s^2/(kg m), so mathcal F_ab in m^-1 and Q in m^-2. With angular coordinates use the tensor transformation/Jacobian, not uniform coordinate component units. Integrals of mathcal F on spheres have metres. Preserve observer signs F0i=-Ei/c, Fij=epsilon_ijk Bk and signature -+++.",
      "consumers": "Same reviewer must inspect all actual direct/indirect consumers listed in targets; current count25 (batches14,21,22), four direct. Restore exact normalization claim in KN/RN supporting facts and remove stale mismatch disclaimers, while retaining geometric proof and qualifications. Adding alpha to def-emg-xs-geometric-electrovac would change another public Definition and expand closure; unnecessary: theorem-level SI equivalence can be stated locally with explicit scale and trace-free argument. For Lambda=0/no matter, trace T=0 gives S=0, hence G=Ric and source equation equivalent to Ric=2Q(mathcal F); d/star commute with constant alpha. No gravitational existence or charge quantization follows."
    },
    {
      "subject": "two missing typed definitions",
      "confirmed": "Neither extended-product nor Lp carrier exists; no producer in any of80 current run manifests. Original proposed inventory reserves published EMG-MG01, outside selected frontier. Typed-agent eight explicitly exclude these two. Batch21 RN curvature and ten already-authored batch22 consumers declare both.",
      "placement": "Smallest no-new-pair placement is earliest selected mathematical A page emg-mg02, batch2, before current connection items, by explicit Root extension and coordinated writer drain. Do not edit/publish MG01 or alter imported/root suppliers. No later pending manifest producer was found.",
      "extended_product": "Exact foundational-replacements.md#extended-product: on ordered extended real set define star=0 if either factor0, ordinary real multiplication if both finite, otherwise sign product with infinite magnitude; pointwise lift. Explicit total table/finite sign formula proves unique value. Distinguish this NEW convention from partial arithmetic of def-extended-reals: never rewrite its undefined 0 times infinity. No general measurability assertion without finite/zero/infinite sign-set decomposition proof. Dependency def-extended-reals.",
      "Lp": "Exact foundational-replacements.md#lp-representatives: measure space, measurable REAL-valued representatives, p in[1,infinity), integral|f|^p finite; p=infinity essential boundedness. f~g iff measurable inequality-set has measure0; [f] and named representative f distinguished; a.e.-invariant predicates descend, point evaluation generally does not. Exact published quotient and norm theorem supply equivalence/norm, with explicit real Borel codomain. Complex Sobolev via real/imag coordinates only. Dependencies def-measure-space, def-measurable-function-between-measurable-spaces, def-l-p-space-as-a-quotient-by-null-functions, thm-the-l-p-norm-descends-to-the-quotient-and-makes-l-p-a-normed-space.",
      "closure_limit": "These are local typed definitions, not repairs of inherited imported remark edges. RN-curvature actual polynomial/continuity proof does not use extended products or Lp classes directly; retain declared full planned dependency obligations, do not manufacture their acceptance or narrow scope to remove them. Exact original closure review remains separate owner duty."
    }
  ]
